              { date: 'Nov 2025', title: 'Urged USDA to distribute SNAP funding after Shapiro sues federal government',
                sub: 'Publicly pushed for food assistance funding for nearly 2 million Pennsylvanians after federal holdback', tag: 'Federal relations' },
              { date: 'Oct 2025', title: 'Lebanon County — new regional police departments',
